OL,3,GNEWSAReading for pleasure can improve
OL,4,Awellbeing - study
OL,5,
OL,6,FReading for pleasure can improve health
OL,7,Fand wellbeing at any age and regardless
OL,8,Fof what you read, University of
OL,9,FCambridge academics have said.
OL,11,FProf Barbara Sahakian and Dr Christelle
OL,12,FLangley, from the university's
OL,13,Fdepartment of psychiatry, argued that
OL,14,Freading boosts mental health and
OL,15,Facademic performance, leading to
OL,16,Fgreater empathy and lowering the risk
OL,17,Fof dementia.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
